{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for DealDash', 'description': 'Primary container for DealDash implementation: SnagLocal is a mobile app that alerts users to flash sales and discounts at nearby stores, restaurants, or cafes based on their real-time location. It aggregates deals from public APIs and user submissions, displays a countdown timer for each deal, and uses push notifications to create urgency. The app is monetized via ads and affiliate links, and features a simple, intuitive UI for quick deal discovery.', 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Location-Based Deal Alerts",\n      "description": "Notifies users of flash sales and discounts at nearby businesses using geolocation.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Deal Aggregation",\n      "description": "Pulls deals from public APIs (Yelp, RetailMeNot) and user submissions for comprehensive coverage.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Deal Timer",\n      "description": "Displays a countdown timer for each deal to show remaining validity and create urgency.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "User Authentication",\n      "description": "Uses Firebase Authentication for secure user login and account management.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Push Notifications",\n      "description": "Sends real-time alerts about new or expiring deals using Firebase Cloud Messaging.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Ad & Affiliate Monetization",\n      "description": "Integrates Google AdMob and affiliate APIs (e.g., Amazon Associates) for revenue generation.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Simple UI/UX",\n      "description": "Features an intuitive, easy-to-navigate interface for quick deal discovery and interaction.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#000000",\n    "secondary": "#FFFFFF",\n    "accent": "#00BFAE"\n  },\n  "theme": "dark",\n  "layoutDescription": "The app opens to a map or list view showing nearby deals with prominent deal cards. Each card displays the business name, deal details, distance, and a live countdown timer. A filter bar allows users to sort by category (e.g., food, retail). A bottom navigation bar provides quick access to Home, My Deals, Submit Deal, and Profile. Push notifications appear as banners. The UI uses large, readable fonts and clear call-to-action buttons for claiming deals or viewing details."\n}'}",
